  heuristics' amendment conventions; flagged to Katie in the phase report —
  doctrine wording is hers to overrule).
- **PB (secondary, only if PA blocks or closes with scope to spare)** — the
  gallery error card (the visual suite photographs no invalid specimen), and
  the dependency-free commit-boundary helper closing both allowlisted parity
  gaps (`commit-boundary`, `search-clear-action`, expiry 2027-02-28).

Close PA double-clean via `scripts/review-gate.sh` and report on a new PR.
Codex is usage-capped until 2026-08-17; the live second reviewer is Katie's
Cursor tracking board — ask her to run it rather than self-waiving.

